+# Testing
+
+## Local quality checks
+
+```bash
+./bin/lint-php.sh
+php tests/php/run.php
+composer install
+composer check
+npm install
+npm run check
+docker compose config --quiet
+```
+
+The Composer checks run PHP syntax, WordPress Coding Standards, PHPStan, and the lightweight behavior tests. The npm checks lint the product-admin JavaScript and custom CSS and parse tracked JSON/YAML files.
+
+### Development-only dependency rationale
+
+- `wp-coding-standards/wpcs` + the Composer PHPCS installer enforce WordPress PHP conventions without affecting production.
+- `phpstan/phpstan` + `szepeviktor/phpstan-wordpress` provide WordPress-aware static analysis without shipping runtime code.
+- `eslint` and `stylelint` lint the small custom admin JavaScript/CSS surface; `stylelint-config-standard` supplies maintained baseline rules.
+- `yaml` is used only by the local/CI configuration validator because Node has no built-in YAML parser.
+
+No new production PHP or JavaScript dependency is introduced by issues #1–#5.
+
+## Clean WordPress smoke test
+
+```bash
+cp .env.example .env
+# Change the local-only passwords if desired.
+./bin/smoke-wordpress.sh
+```
+
+The smoke test installs WordPress, activates `mba-site-core` and `mba-menuiseries`, creates a product plus generated test image, restarts the containers, confirms the product/media persist, and verifies the product type remains registered if another installed theme is activated.
+
+## Manual issue #5 admin checks
+
+1. Open **Products → Add New** and confirm all structured fields, required/optional labels, photo guidance, and PDF guidance are visible.
+2. Upload portrait and landscape images to the Media Library; assign/reorder gallery items and verify the stored order after reload.
+3. Select a non-PDF attachment as `mba_technical_document` by manipulating the request or REST client; save and confirm the plugin rejects it with an admin error.
+4. Relate a product to a FAQ and project; verify `mba_related_products` on both related records contains the product ID, then remove the relationship and verify the backlink is removed.
+5. Leave every optional image/field empty and confirm the editor saves without warnings.
+6. Test keyboard navigation through buttons, repeaters, media actions, and relationship selects.
+
+## Browser verification viewports
+
+Capture the homepage at 390×844 and 1440×1000, plus Products list, product editor, public/preview product, and one validation/empty state. Confirm no console errors, clipping, broken media, unreadable focus states, or accidental third-party branding.
